        "original_id": "0a47745e-a118-5972-9a76-090466060092",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Magic (radio network)\n- People: Dusty Springfield, Elvis Presley, The Beach Boys, Roy Orbison, Rod Stewart\n- Concepts: radio playlists, pop music careers\n\nFacts:\n- Dusty Springfield was the stage name of Mary Isobel Catherine Bernadette O'Brien, who was born on 16 April 1939 and died on 2 March 1999.\n- Dusty Springfield was an English pop singer and record producer whose career lasted from the late 1950s to the 1990s.\n- Magic is a radio network whose playlist draws music from the 1950s to the 1970s.\n- Magic's playlist includes music from Elvis Presley, The Beach Boys, Roy Orbison, Dusty Springfield, and Rod Stewart.",
